  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till h&#xe4;lsektorprogram i Bangladesh perioden 2006-2011, avtalet har f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngts en g&#xe5;ng. Fokus p&#xe5; utsatta grupper s&#xe4;rskilt fattiga, kvinnor, barn och &#xe4;ldre. M&#xe5;l att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra h&#xe4;lsovillkoren f&#xf6;r dessa och att st&#xe4;rka h&#xe4;lsosystemet i B-desh f&#xf6;r att leverra kvalitativ h&#xe4;lsv&#xe5;rd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable improvement of health and nutrition and welfare status of the population of Bangladesh, especially vulnerable groups; the poor, women and the children, and the elderly is the goal of Health Nutrition and Population Sector Programme, July 2005 to June 2010 with a possibility of extension upto June 2011.Agreement amended to June 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
